                <pb facs="0831" n="817" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v1/pg817"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Richardson, Acting
                        Secretary of the Treasury, to collector,
                        Mobile.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Treasury Department</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >September</hi> 4, 1869</date></dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Collector of Customs</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Mobile, Alabama:</hi></p>
                <p>Whenever called upon by the proper authority, you are permitted to place Delaware
                    at command to stop filibustering expeditions to Cuba.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WM. A. RICHARDSON,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of
                            Treasury.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
